This repository distributes COMPILED ARTIFACTS of the Veizik runtime for NVIDIA GPUs
on Linux. It is not open source. Neither the source nor the toolchain that compiles it is
included here, and neither is licensed by this file.

1. OWNERSHIP AND SCOPE
   The "Software" means the distributed binaries: the engines, their sealed GPU code
   and other protected runtime assets, the `veizik` command-line tool, the launchers,
   the installer and the model catalogue, as published in the release assets of this repository. They are
   the exclusive property of LinkPick and are protected by copyright and trade-secret law.

   The "Documentation" means the text files in this repository. It is published so that
   people can read, quote and check it, and this licence does not restrict doing so; it
   remains copyright LinkPick, and the Software's terms are not changed by anything in it.

